World "DivRules"
Title "Divisibility Rules"


Introduction
"
Welcome to Divisibility Rules!

Do you remember learning divisibility rules in school? \"A number is divisible by 9 if the sum of its digits is divisible by 9\", or \"A number is divisible by 10 if it ends in 0\".

In this world, we won't just memorize these rules — we will prove them! With `mod_add_multiple`, `mod_shrink`, and `polynomial_cong` in your toolkit, you'll see how all of these classic rules fall out in just a couple of lines.
"
